{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 24,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 542.224,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.062,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Amalekites and the Amulonites and the Lamanites",
      "verse": "24:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.242,
      "end": 9.747,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who were in the land of Amulon, and also in the land of Helam,",
      "verse": "24:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 9.927,
      "end": 12.203,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and who were in the land of Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "24:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 12.383,
      "end": 15.216,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in fine, in all the land round about,",
      "verse": "24:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 15.396,
      "end": 17.346,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had not been converted",
      "verse": "24:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 17.526,
      "end": 20.916,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had not taken upon them the name of Anti-Nephi-Lehi,",
      "verse": "24:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 21.096,
      "end": 24.811,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "were stirred up by the Amalekites and by the Amulonites",
      "verse": "24:1",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 24.991,
      "end": 27.499,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to anger against their brethren.",
      "verse": "24:1",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 28.179,
      "end": 39.603,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And their hatred became exceedingly sore against them, even insomuch that they began to rebel against their king, insomuch that they would not that he should be their king;",
      "verse": "24:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 39.783,
      "end": 43.87,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, they took up arms against the people of Anti-Nephi-Lehi.",
      "verse": "24:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 44.55,
      "end": 47.569,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the king conferred the kingdom upon his son,",
      "verse": "24:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 47.749,
      "end": 50.071,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he called his name Anti-Nephi-Lehi.",
      "verse": "24:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 50.751,
      "end": 53.166,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the king died in that selfsame year",
      "verse": "24:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 53.346,
      "end": 58.176,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Lamanites began to make preparations for war against the people of God.",
      "verse": "24:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 58.856,
      "end": 63.732,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when Ammon and his brethren and all those who had come up with him",
      "verse": "24:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 63.912,
      "end": 67.952,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saw the preparations of the Lamanites to destroy their brethren,",
      "verse": "24:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 68.132,
      "end": 70.361,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they came forth to the land of Midian,",
      "verse": "24:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 70.541,
      "end": 73.049,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there Ammon met all his brethren;",
      "verse": "24:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 73.229,
      "end": 76.015,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and from thence they came to the land of Ishmael",
      "verse": "24:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 76.195,
      "end": 78.889,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might hold a council with Lamoni",
      "verse": "24:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 79.069,
      "end": 81.623,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also with his brother Anti-Nephi-Lehi,",
      "verse": "24:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 81.803,
      "end": 85.286,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "what they should do to defend themselves against the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "24:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 85.966,
      "end": 89.031,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now there was not one soul among all the people",
      "verse": "24:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 89.211,
      "end": 91.719,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had been converted unto the Lord",
      "verse": "24:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 91.899,
      "end": 95.289,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that would take up arms against their brethren;",
      "verse": "24:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 95.469,
      "end": 99.138,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nay, they would not even make any preparations for war;",
      "verse": "24:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 99.318,
      "end": 102.569,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and also their king commanded them that they should not.",
      "verse": "24:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 103.249,
      "end": 108.265,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, these are the words which he said unto the people concerning the matter:",
      "verse": "24:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 108.445,
      "end": 110.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I thank my God, my beloved people,",
      "verse": "24:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 111.04,
      "end": 113.316,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that our great God has in goodness",
      "verse": "24:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 113.496,
      "end": 118.326,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "sent these our brethren, the Nephites, unto us to preach unto us,",
      "verse": "24:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 118.506,
      "end": 122.128,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to convince us of the traditions of our wicked fathers.",
      "verse": "24:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 122.808,
      "end": 125.037,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, I thank my great God",
      "verse": "24:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 125.217,
      "end": 128.932,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he has given us a portion of his Spirit to soften our hearts,",
      "verse": "24:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 129.112,
      "end": 133.524,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we have opened a correspondence with these brethren, the Nephites.",
      "verse": "24:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 134.204,
      "end": 136.712,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, I also thank my God,",
      "verse": "24:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 136.892,
      "end": 139.075,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that by opening this correspondence",
      "verse": "24:9",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 139.255,
      "end": 144.271,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we have been convinced of our sins, and of the many murders which we have committed.",
      "verse": "24:9",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 144.951,
      "end": 147.552,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I also thank my God, yea, my great God,",
      "verse": "24:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 147.732,
      "end": 151.958,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he hath granted unto us that we might repent of these things,",
      "verse": "24:10",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 152.138,
      "end": 158.222,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also that he hath forgiven us of those our many sins and murders which we have committed,",
      "verse": "24:10",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 158.402,
      "end": 161.049,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and taken away the guilt from our hearts,",
      "verse": "24:10",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 161.229,
      "end": 163.319,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "through the merits of his Son.",
      "verse": "24:10",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 163.999,
      "end": 165.764,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, my brethren,",
      "verse": "24:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 165.944,
      "end": 168.405,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "since it has been all that we could do",
      "verse": "24:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 168.585,
      "end": 171.325,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "(as we were the most lost of all mankind)",
      "verse": "24:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 171.505,
      "end": 176.242,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to repent of all our sins and the many murders which we have committed,",
      "verse": "24:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 176.422,
      "end": 179.533,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to get God to take them away from our hearts,",
      "verse": "24:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 179.713,
      "end": 183.335,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for it was all we could do to repent sufficiently before God",
      "verse": "24:11",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 183.515,
      "end": 185.93,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he would take away our stain\u2014",
      "verse": "24:11",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 186.61,
      "end": 188.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, my best beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "24:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 188.973,
      "end": 191.249,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "since God hath taken away our stains,",
      "verse": "24:12",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 191.429,
      "end": 193.612,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and our swords have become bright,",
      "verse": "24:12",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 193.792,
      "end": 198.064,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then let us stain our swords no more with the blood of our brethren.",
      "verse": "24:12",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 198.744,
      "end": 200.416,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I say unto you,",
      "verse": "24:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 200.596,
      "end": 205.844,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nay, let us retain our swords that they be not stained with the blood of our brethren;",
      "verse": "24:13",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 206.024,
      "end": 209.043,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for perhaps, if we should stain our swords again",
      "verse": "24:13",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 209.223,
      "end": 214.656,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they can no more be washed bright through the blood of the Son of our great God,",
      "verse": "24:13",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 214.836,
      "end": 218.551,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which shall be shed for the atonement of our sins.",
      "verse": "24:13",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 219.231,
      "end": 221.692,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the great God has had mercy on us,",
      "verse": "24:14",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 221.872,
      "end": 224.658,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and made these things known unto us",
      "verse": "24:14",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 224.838,
      "end": 226.556,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we might not perish;",
      "verse": "24:14",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 226.736,
      "end": 230.637,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and he has made these things known unto us beforehand,",
      "verse": "24:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 230.817,
      "end": 234.625,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because he loveth our souls as well as he loveth our children;",
      "verse": "24:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 234.805,
      "end": 238.613,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, in his mercy he doth visit us by his angels,",
      "verse": "24:14",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 238.793,
      "end": 242.137,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the plan of salvation might be made known unto us",
      "verse": "24:14",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 242.317,
      "end": 244.918,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as well as unto future generations.",
      "verse": "24:14",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 245.598,
      "end": 247.363,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Oh, how merciful is our God!",
      "verse": "24:15",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 247.543,
      "end": 253.441,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, since it has been as much as we could do to get our stains taken away from us,",
      "verse": "24:15",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 253.621,
      "end": 255.989,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and our swords are made bright,",
      "verse": "24:15",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 256.169,
      "end": 257.702,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "let us hide them away",
      "verse": "24:15",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 257.882,
      "end": 260.018,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may be kept bright,",
      "verse": "24:15",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 260.198,
      "end": 263.031,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as a testimony to our God at the last day,",
      "verse": "24:15",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 263.211,
      "end": 268.273,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or at the day that we shall be brought to stand before him to be judged,",
      "verse": "24:15",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 268.453,
      "end": 272.168,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we have not stained our swords in the blood of our brethren",
      "verse": "24:15",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 272.348,
      "end": 276.713,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "since he imparted his word unto us and has made us clean thereby.",
      "verse": "24:15",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 277.393,
      "end": 278.693,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my brethren,",
      "verse": "24:16",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 278.873,
      "end": 281.241,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if our brethren seek to destroy us,",
      "verse": "24:16",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 281.421,
      "end": 283.789,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, we will hide away our swords,",
      "verse": "24:16",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 283.969,
      "end": 287.173,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even we will bury them deep in the earth",
      "verse": "24:16",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 287.353,
      "end": 289.489,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may be kept bright,",
      "verse": "24:16",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 289.669,
      "end": 294.174,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as a testimony that we have never used them, at the last day;",
      "verse": "24:16",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 294.354,
      "end": 296.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and if our brethren destroy us,",
      "verse": "24:16",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 296.67,
      "end": 299.921,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, we shall go to our God and shall be saved.",
      "verse": "24:16",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 300.601,
      "end": 305.756,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that when the king had made an end of these sayings,",
      "verse": "24:17",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 305.936,
      "end": 308.258,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all the people were assembled together,",
      "verse": "24:17",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 308.438,
      "end": 310.899,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they took their swords, and all the weapons",
      "verse": "24:17",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 311.079,
      "end": 314.423,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were used for the shedding of man's blood,",
      "verse": "24:17",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 314.603,
      "end": 316.925,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did bury them up deep in the earth.",
      "verse": "24:17",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 317.605,
      "end": 319.045,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And this they did,",
      "verse": "24:18",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 319.225,
      "end": 323.823,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it being in their view a testimony to God, and also to men,",
      "verse": "24:18",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 324.003,
      "end": 327.997,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they never would use weapons again for the shedding of man's blood;",
      "verse": "24:18",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 328.177,
      "end": 335.979,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this they did, vouching and covenanting with God that rather than shed the blood of their brethren",
      "verse": "24:18",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 336.159,
      "end": 338.342,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they would give up their own lives;",
      "verse": "24:18",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 338.522,
      "end": 342.934,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and rather than take away from a brother they would give unto him;",
      "verse": "24:18",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 343.114,
      "end": 346.225,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and rather than spend their days in idleness",
      "verse": "24:18",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 346.405,
      "end": 349.145,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they would labor abundantly with their hands.",
      "verse": "24:18",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 349.825,
      "end": 351.358,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus we see that,",
      "verse": "24:19",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 351.538,
      "end": 355.393,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when these Lamanites were brought to believe and to know the truth,",
      "verse": "24:19",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 355.573,
      "end": 361.146,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were firm, and would suffer even unto death rather than commit sin;",
      "verse": "24:19",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 361.326,
      "end": 364.437,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus we see that they buried their weapons of peace,",
      "verse": "24:19",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 364.617,
      "end": 367.45,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or they buried the weapons of war, for peace.",
      "verse": "24:19",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 368.13,
      "end": 373.563,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that their brethren, the Lamanites, made preparations for war,",
      "verse": "24:20",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 373.743,
      "end": 378.155,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and came up to the land of Nephi for the purpose of destroying the king,",
      "verse": "24:20",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 378.335,
      "end": 380.564,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to place another in his stead,",
      "verse": "24:20",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 380.744,
      "end": 385.992,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also of destroying the people of Anti-Nephi-Lehi out of the land.",
      "verse": "24:20",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 386.672,
      "end": 390.016,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when the people saw that they were coming against them",
      "verse": "24:21",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 390.196,
      "end": 391.914,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they went out to meet them,",
      "verse": "24:21",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 392.094,
      "end": 394.927,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and prostrated themselves before them to the earth,",
      "verse": "24:21",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 395.107,
      "end": 397.615,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to call on the name of the Lord;",
      "verse": "24:21",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 397.795,
      "end": 400.024,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus they were in this attitude",
      "verse": "24:21",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 400.204,
      "end": 402.99,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when the Lamanites began to fall upon them,",
      "verse": "24:21",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 403.17,
      "end": 405.446,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to slay them with the sword.",
      "verse": "24:21",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 406.126,
      "end": 408.448,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus without meeting any resistance,",
      "verse": "24:22",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 408.628,
      "end": 411.322,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they did slay a thousand and five of them;",
      "verse": "24:22",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 411.502,
      "end": 413.731,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we know that they are blessed,",
      "verse": "24:22",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 413.911,
      "end": 416.372,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they have gone to dwell with their God.",
      "verse": "24:22",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 417.052,
      "end": 421.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when the Lamanites saw that their brethren would not flee from the sword,",
      "verse": "24:23",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 421.876,
      "end": 425.452,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither would they turn aside to the right hand or to the left,",
      "verse": "24:23",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 425.632,
      "end": 427.35,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but that they would lie down",
      "verse": "24:23",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 427.53,
      "end": 428.691,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and perish,",
      "verse": "24:23",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 428.871,
      "end": 433.19,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and praised God even in the very act of perishing under the sword\u2014",
      "verse": "24:23",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 433.87,
      "end": 436.053,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when the Lamanites saw this",
      "verse": "24:24",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 436.233,
      "end": 438.555,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they did forbear from slaying them;",
      "verse": "24:24",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 438.735,
      "end": 441.893,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there were many whose hearts had swollen in them",
      "verse": "24:24",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 442.073,
      "end": 445.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for those of their brethren who had fallen under the sword,",
      "verse": "24:24",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 445.968,
      "end": 449.033,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they repented of the things which they had done.",
      "verse": "24:24",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 449.713,
      "end": 453.289,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they threw down their weapons of war,",
      "verse": "24:25",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 453.469,
      "end": 455.466,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they would not take them again,",
      "verse": "24:25",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 455.646,
      "end": 459.083,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they were stung for the murders which they had committed;",
      "verse": "24:25",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 459.263,
      "end": 462.096,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they came down even as their brethren,",
      "verse": "24:25",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 462.276,
      "end": 466.688,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "relying upon the mercies of those whose arms were lifted to slay them.",
      "verse": "24:25",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 467.368,
      "end": 470.619,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the people of God were joined that day",
      "verse": "24:26",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 470.799,
      "end": 473.4,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "by more than the number who had been slain;",
      "verse": "24:26",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 473.58,
      "end": 476.134,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and those who had been slain were righteous people,",
      "verse": "24:26",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 476.314,
      "end": 480.354,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore we have no reason to doubt but what they were saved.",
      "verse": "24:26",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 481.034,
      "end": 484.006,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there was not a wicked man slain among them;",
      "verse": "24:27",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 484.186,
      "end": 488.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but there were more than a thousand brought to the knowledge of the truth;",
      "verse": "24:27",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 488.638,
      "end": 493.096,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thus we see that the Lord worketh in many ways to the salvation of his people.",
      "verse": "24:27",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 493.776,
      "end": 499.163,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the greatest number of those of the Lamanites who slew so many of their brethren",
      "verse": "24:28",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 499.343,
      "end": 501.804,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "were Amalekites and Amulonites,",
      "verse": "24:28",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 501.984,
      "end": 505.931,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the greatest number of whom were after the order of the Nehors.",
      "verse": "24:28",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 506.611,
      "end": 509.537,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, among those who joined the people of the Lord,",
      "verse": "24:29",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 509.717,
      "end": 513.386,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there were none who were Amalekites or Amulonites,",
      "verse": "24:29",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 513.566,
      "end": 515.842,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or who were of the order of Nehor,",
      "verse": "24:29",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 516.022,
      "end": 519.551,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but they were actual descendants of Laman and Lemuel.",
      "verse": "24:29",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 520.231,
      "end": 526.686,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus we can plainly discern that after a people have been once enlightened by the Spirit of God,",
      "verse": "24:30",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 526.866,
      "end": 530.906,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have had great knowledge of things pertaining to righteousness,",
      "verse": "24:30",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 531.086,
      "end": 536.009,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and then have fallen away into sin and transgression, they become more hardened,",
      "verse": "24:30",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 536.189,
      "end": 538.511,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus their state becomes worse",
      "verse": "24:30",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 538.691,
      "end": 541.57,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "than though they had never known these things.",
      "verse": "24:30",
      "lineIndex": 153
    }
  ]
}